#: ../../source/libraries/time.rst:159
msgid "Displaying the Value"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/libraries/time.rst:161
msgid ""
"Since the Time class extends DateTimeImmutable, you get all of the output"
" methods that provides, including the ``format()`` method. However, the "
"DateTimeImmutable methods do not provide a localized result. The Time "
"class does provide a number of helper methods to display localized "
"versions of the value, though."
msgstr ""

