"This is the localized version of DateTimeImmutable's ``format()`` method."
" Instead of using the values you might be familiar with, though, you must"
" use values acceptable to the `IntlDateFormatter "
"<https://www.php.net/manual/en/class.intldateformatter.php>`__ class. A "
"full listing of values can be found `here <https://unicode-org.github.io"
"/icu-docs/apidoc/released/icu4c/classSimpleDateFormat.html#details>`__."
msgstr ""

